Key                   Accepts                                      Default
cache.dir             a directory                                  none, caching off
cache.readOnly        true or false                                false
cache.requireDigest   true or false                                false
cache.ttl             a duration such as 12h; 0s, no expiry        24h
log.format            console, json or text                        console
log.level             trace, debug, info, warn or error            info
offline               true or false                                false
output.evidence       true or false                                false
output.offerInstall   true or false                                true
output.tips           true or false                                true
output.top            a whole number of 0 or more                  10 for scan, every row for diff
output.view           findings, actions or compact                 findings
publish.apiUrl        a URL                                        none
scan.jobs             a whole number of 0 or more; 0, one per CPU  0
tools.<tool>.version  a release, such as 0.69.3                    Draugr's pin

Tools: cosign, gitleaks, gosec, govulncheck, grype, kube-bench, notation,
nuclei, retire, semgrep, syft, trivy.

Controls, each a block of its own:
  controls.cloud       prowler
  controls.dast        nuclei
  controls.headers     draugrHeaders
  controls.iac         trivyConfig
  controls.images      trivy, grype*
  controls.kubernetes  draugrK8sPolicies, kubeBench*, kubeBenchJob*
  controls.licenses    trivyLicense, mendLicenses*
  controls.provenance  cosign, notation
  controls.sast        semgrep, gosec*
  controls.sca         trivyFs, grypeFs*, mendSca*, retirejs*
  controls.secrets     gitleaks
  controls.threats     urlhaus, virustotal*
  controls.tls         draugrTls
* opt-in. `draugr config keys controls.<control>` lists one control's keys.
